+## `percent.bin`
+
+One byte, 0-100: the whole-book reading percentage saved when the reader was
+last left (also in `/.crosspoint/xtc_<hash>/` for XTC books). 100 means the
+book was read to the end. The Library list shows it beside each book; a
+missing file or any other value shows nothing. It is written through a
+temporary file and only into a cache folder that already exists.
+
